---
import '@fontsource-variable/syne';
import '@fontsource-variable/manrope';
import '../styles/test6.css';

const projects = [
  { number: '01', name: 'Webigram', type: 'Digital experiences', href: '/' },
  { number: '02', name: 'Coursino Live', type: 'Real-time connection', href: 'https://live.webigram.ir' },
  { number: '03', name: 'Updateshid', type: 'Ideas into knowledge', href: 'https://updateshid.ir' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101211" />
    <meta name="description" content="Enter a different dimension of Webigram. An interactive exploration of design, engineering, and digital possibility." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Webigram — A different dimension</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="scene-shell" id="scene-shell" aria-hidden="true">
      <canvas id="orbital-canvas"></canvas>
      <div class="scene-shade"></div>
      <div class="scene-grain"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="scene-fallback" id="scene-fallback" role="status" hidden>
      <span class="eyebrow">THE ORBITAL ENGINE</span>
      <p>The interactive sculpture needs a browser with 3D graphics enabled. You can still explore everything below.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="model-surface" id="model-surface" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Interactive Orbital Engine. Drag to rotate, or use the arrow keys. Press R to reset." aria-describedby="model-help" hidden></div>
    <p class="sr-only" id="model-help">Use left and right arrows to turn the sculpture and up and down arrows to tilt it. Press R to reset. Use the controls below to change material or separate its parts.</p>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Webigram home">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 52" width="35" height="29" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7 16 45 28 14l8 31L60 7" /></svg>
        <span>webigram<span class="brand-period">.</span></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="header-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#approach">Our approach</a>
        <a href="#work">Selected work</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="header-cta" href="/">Main website <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <aside class="chapter-nav" aria-label="Experience chapters">
      <a href="#origin" data-chapter-link="0" aria-label="01, The origin" aria-current="location"><span>01</span><i></i></a>
      <a href="#approach" data-chapter-link="1" aria-label="02, The anatomy"><span>02</span><i></i></a>
      <a href="#work" data-chapter-link="2" aria-label="03, The impact"><span>03</span><i></i></a>
      <a href="#connect" data-chapter-link="3" aria-label="04, Your next move"><span>04</span><i></i></a>
    </aside>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="chapter chapter-origin" id="origin" data-chapter="0" aria-labelledby="origin-heading">
        <div class="chapter-copy hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="tiny-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span> INDEPENDENT THINKING. DIGITAL MAKING.</p>
          <h1 id="origin-heading"><span class="word-mask"><span>A different</span></span><span class="word-mask"><span class="dimension">dimension<span class="lime">.</span></span></span></h1>
          <p class="intro reveal">Good websites get seen.<br />Extraordinary ones get <em>felt.</em></p>
          <a class="round-link reveal" href="#approach"><span class="round-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><span>Explore what’s possible</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="object-note" aria-hidden="true"><span class="note-line"></span><p>ORBITAL / 006<br /><span>A STUDY IN POSSIBILITY</span></p></div>
        <div class="chapter-footer"><span>DESIGN × ENGINEERING × IMAGINATION</span><span class="scroll-cue">SCROLL TO UNFOLD <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter chapter-approach" id="approach" data-chapter="1" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
        <div class="chapter-copy copy-right">
          <p class="eyebrow reveal">02 / THE ANATOMY</p>
          <h2 class="reveal" id="approach-heading">Beautiful outside.<br /><span class="muted">Brilliant within.</span></h2>
          <p class="body-copy reveal">The best digital experiences have more than a beautiful surface. Every layer has a reason. Every detail works together.</p>
          <div class="capabilities">
            <div class="capability reveal"><span class="capability-number">01</span><div><h3>Designed to feel different</h3><p>Distinctive identities. Intuitive interfaces. Motion with purpose.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
            <div class="capability reveal"><span class="capability-number">02</span><div><h3>Engineered to go further</h3><p>Custom websites, applications, and the infrastructure behind them.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
            <div class="capability reveal"><span class="capability-number">03</span><div><h3>Connected by intelligence</h3><p>AI and automation that turn complex work into effortless flow.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chapter-footer"><span>ONE VISION. EVERY LAYER.</span><span>FORM FOLLOWS POSSIBILITY</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter chapter-work" id="work" data-chapter="2" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
        <div class="chapter-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow reveal">03 / THE IMPACT</p>
          <h2 class="reveal" id="work-heading">Ideas don’t<br />belong in <span class="muted">orbit.</span></h2>
          <p class="body-copy reveal">We bring them into the real world.<br />A few places where our thinking comes to life.</p>
          <div class="project-list">
            {projects.map(project => <a class="project reveal" href={project.href} target={project.href === '/' ? undefined : '_blank'} rel={project.href === '/' ? undefined : 'noopener noreferrer'}><span class="project-number">{project.number}</span><span class="project-text"><strong>{project.name}</strong><span>{project.type}</span></span><span class="project-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chapter-footer"><span>BUILT TO BE USED. MADE TO BE REMEMBERED.</span><span>EXPLORE THE WEBIGRAM WORLD</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="chapter chapter-connect" id="connect" data-chapter="3" aria-labelledby="connect-heading">
        <div class="connect-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow reveal">04 / YOUR NEXT MOVE</p>
          <h2 class="reveal" id="connect-heading">The next big thing<br />starts with <span class="lime">your idea.</span></h2>
          <p class="body-copy reveal">Let’s make something the internet hasn’t seen before.</p>
          <a class="contact-link reveal" href="/">Discover Webigram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <footer class="chapter-footer"><a href="/">WEBIGRAM</a><span>A SMALL WINDOW INTO WHAT’S NEXT.</span><a href="#origin" class="back-top">BACK TO TOP ↑</a></footer>
      </section>
    </main>

    <div class="experience-controls" id="experience-controls" hidden>
      <div class="material-switch" role="group" aria-label="Sculpture material">
        <button type="button" data-material="alloy" aria-pressed="true"><i class="swatch swatch-alloy" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Alloy</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-material="pearl" aria-pressed="false"><i class="swatch swatch-pearl" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Pearl</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-material="wire" aria-pressed="false"><i class="swatch swatch-wire" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Wire</span></button>
      </div>
      <span class="control-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <button class="icon-control assemble-control" id="assemble-control" type="button" aria-pressed="false" title="Separate the sculpture’s components"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" height="19" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5Z M3 12l9 5 9-5 M3 16l9 5 9-5" /></svg><span>Unfold</span></button>
      <button class="icon-control" id="motion-control" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Pause animation" title="Pause animation"><span id="pause-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14M16 5v14" /></svg></span><span id="play-icon" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 5 11 7-11 7V5Z" /></svg></span></button>
      <button class="icon-control reset-control" id="reset-control" type="button" aria-label="Reset sculpture view" title="Reset view"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" height="17" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9a8 8 0 1 1 0 6M4 4v5h5" /></svg></button>
    </div>
    <div class="render-status" id="render-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Preparing your dimension…</div>
    <div class="interaction-hint" id="interaction-hint" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">✥</span> DRAG TO EXPLORE</div>
    <div class="reading-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="reading-progress"></span></div>
    <noscript><style>.render-status { display: none; }</style><p class="no-script-note">Enable JavaScript to explore the interactive 3D sculpture. All links and content work without it.</p></noscript>
    <script>
      import '../scripts/test6-experience';
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
